ost_w2gA8rmjnH_16x9.png", "id": "1818699519278915", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831279_1818699522612248_4533455245099816290_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g_OnoahGreIQ7kNvwEX1uev&_nc_oc=AdpqBMUlwB7JpJ04O4HzW13FwnmYpXIXcP7k-LuYa2Jo6CkNgI7nDSFfFP0_f1nSbNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPCYAhhoYP_uym4Yo3yTQAm0gNjNq9X08zXeTKVYgOx7g&oe=6ACE6093"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_WJg5wom5YU_16x9.png", "id": "1645264790487635", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604370996_1645264793820968_1481936203299324057_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3YjdC2xW9CkQ7kNvwFEosx7&_nc_oc=AdrFgKB8SvzEu9ZPvK1E00aIwL0F4-AC9QUZdYjo5Uq_1cN5Gv06DlwigGAdQh2qDD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOkMB21UeiUwJ_P7nOSiSWC9WABCmp6Q0b_Ee4w5NF7Qw&oe=6ACE54DF"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_2JYnPdfHG9_16x9.png", "id": "1027026563684693", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1027026567018026_1660229937269981496_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aPiSMXuPZ6kQ7kNvwEVv18n&_nc_oc=AdrXgjQ3mZY4bP3lmpjuJ0IAnKtwclrPsbanKHtY-dfHx1M1IudxWeR9G5qVD6Osyuc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOhPfN57Npzj2jMywcluL3t4XLMMMuHIV7NByULBzASnA&oe=6ACE3837"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_X6a0Oh3mYa_16x9.png", "id": "2153270322262940", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673652249_2153270325596273_2707198577192042918_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A3MhOjRDgiEQ7kNvwFbGPHE&_nc_oc=AdpEE-YwuS1Wmp0K4dBfSpu7S_E4b53GxXVSoSu67bqTfEtu9jdrhMkKCzQoEgccPwM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOFwi9Hy6EUGXzqthgfKi7iuPwv7MSUa1JyhQ9L_M_UlA&oe=6ACE46D4"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_ho5YNaQE9r_16x9 (1).png", "id": "1067058546131316", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/753032404_1067058549464649_85759188282202320_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V0Ao7JPGPDsQ7kNvwFwKStr&_nc_oc=AdqW96i3ZPtidt1GvU1MPJB7_tfWkPpmulQY3Q-xjFLSBKjpYjA7MH3xdRs3ZtUV6a0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN1Oxg03h1UQmjh_PCS6YAQnz4wKkZdxKBjIx6PuOYxiA&oe=6ACE5C19"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "officialtrailer (1).png", "id": "2685734508548045", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673536876_2685734511881378_3839269232491950372_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MCm4c0uiisMQ7kNvwEeOu_n&_nc_oc=AdrOh79WaeZKsNFEl5SFaBmBWoZtFrYlCNxHgPFckLUJJ2m_PLqTybhihmGMNd_UT54&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPvDWqa-zc9nVEf41xsi1lTMQJIeM_N7oj0jGbfCkqwzw&oe=6ACE4C10"}, "display_name": "UluP Spatial", "keywords": ["produttivit\u00e0", "realt\u00e0mista", "progetti", "mani", "collaborazione"], "long_description": "UluP Spatial porta la mappa dei tuoi progetti UluP Spaces nella realt\u00e0 mista su Quest. Invece di una tela piatta su uno schermo, i nodi del tuo progetto fluttuano intorno a te come veri oggetti 3D che puoi afferrare, spostare e collegare con le tue mani.\n\n**Cosa puoi fare:**\n- Vedi i tuoi progetti e nodi reali, sincronizzati in tempo reale dal tuo account UluP Spaces\n- Afferra e riposiziona i nodi con hand tracking o controller\n- Apri un nodo per vedere e completare i task, aggiungine di nuovi a voce o con la tastiera virtuale\n- Disegna collegamenti tra i nodi per mappare come le tue idee si relazionano\n- Concentrati su un singolo task con note e un timer integrato\n- Visualizza allegati immagine e file direttamente nella scena\n- Lavora sullo stesso progetto insieme a un collaboratore, in tempo reale \u2014 vedi chi \u00e8 online e cosa sta facendo\n- Passa da AR (passthrough, la tua stanza reale) a VR completa\n\nUluP Spatial usa lo stesso account e gli stessi progetti di UluP Spaces (web/desktop) \u2014 niente da configurare due volte, niente di duplicato. Accedi e i tuoi progetti sono gi\u00e0 l\u00ec, incluse eventuali automazioni create con UluP SDK Studio (costruiscine una tu, o importa un template pronto dalla libreria della community \u2014 basta parlare con Claude per crearne una via MCP).", "short_description": "La mappa del tuo progetto, in realt\u00e0 mista. Afferra i nodi, collega le idee, gestisci i task con le mani \u2014 sincronizzata in tempo reale con il tuo account UluP Spaces."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "spatial-banner (1).png", "id": "2382445852525002", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_2382445855858335_7138643287115300965_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ipFsD2W0tdoQ7kNvwH-8M-W&_nc_oc=AdpyFZPKlpLqJ-oZFRhHlK11-6vTDflM1TT0oGboWT4GvBk9YN2ah504r5oR_bw2-zc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOunYSlE9DLkzutneWEOQBvmgXwiSO36vVRxPLhUAXioA&oe=6ACE60BC"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "1608104100808199", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1608104107474865_7754736957045553453_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8yEmXlJhfhAQ7kNvwEAc8KF&_nc_oc=AdpeeUxmwm4PsgYRzhyJP64WxSJWXxA8iTw_bcBCXmbK8qU9wwqY_jL_B58VDDtlw0U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMZXsUkdUdvPaeRRxLVXOfGGVvF35BPsoh3ixOtbSRL7Q&oe=6ACE4301"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT.png", "id": "1593351859005122", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_1593351865671788_2270217285466024058_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4XDnF7Svj-gQ7kNvwEKQIz6&_nc_oc=AdrgrWQ0Hzf7yAcFljjc5Sth6OZ0pgy0y9jY2YvLGcXQHQb1oSPigyOCy6P3VedvuSk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP5S4Q7Sy43IVfT9fcYARbbTF301EcFKpBVHIWtT3Ffag&oe=6ACE5925"}, {"file_name": "ulup-spatial-logo (1).png", "id": "1090972580309949", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825503_1090972583643282_4131135753565673900_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w_xtljdBN3kQ7kNvwGqkiNj&_nc_oc=AdouGWr9qPL5F--P4r3woUVSKd8EVnUDmkNwkPF-1jgbVcQ1E5w0Z6LUdvNybTb3r8I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNAAYjvs6Mlqvpcq0J56QSR9fpJtsdxzywGeTIxv0bmFQ&oe=6ACE4DDE"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "1090636453800314", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_1090636457133647_6442307859406608571_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R72KHTIl8xMQ7kNvwFXQTbM&_nc_oc=AdrmEauKpcmoTtpf7hPzHe8p_s-8xAhMEGKuEg5pD1mfg0rxQxJDMHlr43O-V9k_jpQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNvgSIIRUu_vtnf2NGn-kjwIMWDc4mdfRpmdgHLbQ7egQ&oe=6ACE6AE9"}]}, "id": "995602590224627", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_X6a0Oh3mYa_16x9.png", "id": "1677074717114370", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604347072_1677074720447703_5618519853673493455_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PKaYU7EA0lQQ7kNvwFx-DNm&_nc_oc=Adph8tkUJsPypnqSvyGRkz7u8aljivtnZ9pE8S7BIGltDZVga9JrLR6MEaIuNg61SaU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP26QXVI3Mx7lVK4c1uTVOg_JPhZuKfhKW7ORpqWwoOHQ&oe=6ACE5E37"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_2JYnPdfHG9_16x9.png", "id": "1621134649514967", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1621134652848300_1490796086755638049_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g-vPP8kdWJkQ7kNvwGyIUT1&_nc_oc=AdqeOGxWcdD0sEyTRrWwzcULEKHMk0d-xLJ5xdFV3rLi028qjm-jF2rvRGgT9ey2zeA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM8owymoOCCUSyhUKsASIdaiKVmI2EOAqbR7g5z4kFleQ&oe=6ACE352D"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_w2gA8rmjnH_16x9.png", "id": "1076269148371312", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604385997_1076269155037978_773783658790453776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C_so542TT7wQ7kNvwEsERU2&_nc_oc=AdrtGgYwMu6YUHEbrxJu5fsWsy_HWkSQ52DsC_MyzWlht0Zsl8O_0NOJkGoBknHslx4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNEe1WkkH8bmpni5mydnOkY69bitFtYlD1IXgR1c9zaJQ&oe=6ACE5B9F"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_WJg5wom5YU_16x9.png", "id": "1839101883739871", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673573223_1839101887073204_1369626186002792851_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JNi-JccCw_kQ7kNvwEjnGBk&_nc_oc=AdpSGdch5MfQBzIXlKWntZeLVf-I3Bjd9_rLXLDIFFyRNYju99yjSlvQLUAtA0Meh_k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPFZuQtK2UjMv3hgAZ5ZEOFxmZSoJXSQ2llyFTgzUUkVg&oe=6ACE4FC4"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_ho5YNaQE9r_16x9 (1).png", "id": "1627886348715787", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1627886352049120_8054576045411958904_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a9sC10x67HAQ7kNvwHPDj_N&_nc_oc=Adp5ppETFgdgatqAL4p3qpIq-3sXpgMwW4OlmEhP8d0XbWJw58kNueff0-34tNL1EgI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMiMfy_QPT9qElAtn8cSLbXZCEp5TWtTwB4iwD-PpRO5Q&oe=6ACE3F56"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "officialtrailer (1).png", "id": "1410773183811260", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596168449_1410773187144593_6502129704163225488_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jSIN5i4puekQ7kNvwFop4n-&_nc_oc=AdqN6b2xCsU-jRdxe2e9bumVLU2GbwFVmBwG90P0udhShr65QbUWzf2f0lwGoDmwFrk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP9lJVwJweZJvk02cEh33jwbX9M2o4chr9Ja7AMEj9BBA&oe=6ACE69A8"}, "display_name": "UluP Spatial", "keywords": ["productivity", "projects", "mixedreality", "handtracking", "collaboration"], "long_description": "UluP Spatial brings your UluP Spaces project map into mixed reality on Quest. Instead of a flat canvas on a screen, your project's nodes float around you as real 3D objects you grab, move and connect with your own hands.\n\n**What you can do:**\n- See your real projects and nodes, synced live from your UluP Spaces account\n- Grab and reposition nodes with hand tracking or controllers\n- Open a node to view and check off tasks, add new ones by voice or virtual keyboard\n- Draw connections between nodes to map how your ideas relate\n- Focus on a single task with notes and a built-in timer\n- View image and file attachments directly in the scene\n- Work on the same project together with a collaborator, in real time \u2014 see who's online and what they're working on\n- Switch between AR (passthrough, your real room) and full VR\n\nUluP Spatial uses the same account and the same projects as UluP Spaces (web/desktop) \u2014 nothing to set up twice, nothing duplicated. Sign in and your projects are already there, including any automation you've built with UluP SDK Studio (build one yourself, or import a ready-made one from the community template library \u2014 just talk to Claude to create one via MCP).", "short_description": "Your project map, in mixed reality. Grab nodes, connect ideas, manage tasks with your hands \u2014 synced live with your UluP Spaces account."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/privacy", "publisher_name": "UluP Studio", "support_website_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/support", "website_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_a